 ('mockingbird-material','Mockingbird edition description and plot commentary','Mostly Dystopian Books editorial description','https://www.mostlydystopianbooks.com/pages/books/11129/walter-tevis/mockingbird','bookseller_secondary_commentary','Food/clothing are dispensed automatically and robot maintenance supports the declining city.','Bookseller commentary, not primary confirmation; exact population/children claims are not adopted where summaries differ.'),
