 ('spacer','2312','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2312_(novel)','secondary_setting_reference','Quantum computers coordinate a Mondragon-influenced planned economy alongside artificial habitats and terrariums.','Economic coordination is not proof of sovereign machine rule or of all productive labor disappearing.'),
